{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansion pack #9 helps you fight the war on all fronts: Offensive, defensive, long range, short range and economic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This expansion pack has 3 Buildings with a new mechanic called Range, the one with 2 Defense and a Legendary one with 10 Production!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Weapon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy your Enemy's card from the safety of your own home. Or blast them at short range, and repeat next turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054340/extras/b60ad70f37613daf0bf023b43c7619ad.avif?t=1760009536\" width=350 height=385 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Very Productive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Production and 2 Money would be worth buying this. Getting\u00a0faster build times and cooldowns is a very sweet bonus. And if that's not enough, you get 2 more Money if the Enemy is in Range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054340/extras/bf2e7b80073fa0dc718d82cc7d821068.avif?t=1760009536\" width=350 height=385 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defense!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who really like to turtle up in their own base, this card is the dream! And just the thing you need to protect your other sweet buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054340/extras/38c82fb51949d22db859181de05b0807.avif?t=1760009536\" width=350 height=385 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054340?t=1760009536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054340?t=1760009536","capsule_ima